This product is a fork of youtube-digest (https://github.com/zarazhangrui/youtube-digest),
adapted for Bilibili (B 站) and additional features. Both the original work and the
modifications are released under the MIT License (see LICENSE in this repository).

**Project name history**:
- V0.x (2026-06 to 2026-08-22): published as `bilidown`
- V1.0 (2026-08-23 onwards): renamed to `Suikan` (随看), positioning upgraded
  from "B 站专用适配版" to "通用学习视频助手" — Bilibili is the first supported
  platform; YouTube, Douyin, TED, Coursera etc. are planned next.
- The rename is a brand and packaging change only. All commit history from
  the V0.x series is preserved. No business logic, no data, no API contracts
  were changed as part of the rename.

