What this fork changes
=======================
- Re-targets the extension from youtube.com to bilibili.com (B 站):
  page integration, video identification (BV id / 分 P / 合集分集), and the
  in-page action button are all rewritten for the B 站 DOM.
- Replaces the Supadata transcript pipeline with a B 站-native one
  (`/x/player/wbi/v2` endpoint with bvid/cid validation), and adds optional
  阿里云百炼 Fun-ASR as the default speech-to-text path when an API key is
  configured.
- Replaces the YouTube player integration with the B 站 player, including
  fullscreen-mode notes.
- Translates the side panel, options page, and prompts into Simplified
  Chinese with a B 站-themed visual style.
- Adds mid-video isolation, multi-format export (Markdown / HTML / clipboard
  for 飞书), and a local cache keyed by bvid+cid (the cid is the authoritative
  lookup key, since titles and bvid are shared across multi-part videos).
- Adds a 切换页面不中断转录 safeguard for the local Whisper pipeline
  (chrome.alarms keepalive + server-side cache write + a watchdog that
  recovers orphaned jobs).
- Adds Traditional → Simplified Chinese normalization on the server side
  (via zhconv) so transcripts produced by whisper-tiny/base on Mandarin
  audio come out in 简体.
- Adds a 切页 not-yet-tab-aware panel-DOM reset so users who switch to a new
  B 站 video while the side panel is open don't see the previous video's
  chapter list / summary text.

What is preserved
=================
- The core product idea (long video → readable + searchable + summarizable
  study material, with timestamped notes) is unchanged.
- The MIT License terms are preserved exactly.
- The original copyright line in LICENSE is preserved unchanged.

